 ],
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hero-01",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Stage three, unit seven. Small words, big work.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-02",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This unit is about particles. Each one is called a ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-03",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الحُرُوفُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "wm"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-04",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A ḥarf never changes, and it has no iʿrāb place.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-05",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Its job is to work on the words around it.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-01",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter one. Every ḥarf is fixed, with no place.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-02",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Pronouns, pointing words and question isms are fixed.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-03",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "But they still have a place. Rafʿ, naṣb or jarr.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-04",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A ḥarf is different. It is fixed, and it has no place at all.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:It is fixed and it has no place at all."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-rule-01",
   "scene": "c01-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here is the phrase we use for a ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-rule-02",
   "scene": "c01-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "حَرْفٌ مَبْنِيٌّ لَا مَحَلَّ لَهُ مِنَ الإِعْرَابِ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "hl:حَرْفٌ مَبْنِيٌّ لَا مَحَلَّ لَهُ مِنَ الإِعْرَابِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-rule-03",
   "scene": "c01-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A fixed ḥarf with no place in iʿrāb.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:A fixed ḥarf with no place in iʿrāb."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-01",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This unit has five groups of ḥarfs.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-02",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "First, the jarr ḥarfs, such as from, to and in.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-03",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The joining ḥarfs, like wa, which means and.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-04",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The answer ḥarfs, for yes and no.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-05",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The question ḥarfs, for a yes or no question.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "col:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-06",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And the calling ḥarf, to call someone.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "col:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-cols-07",
   "scene": "c01-cols",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Let us take them one by one.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-01",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter two. The jarr ḥarfs.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-02",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "حُرُوفُ الجَرِّ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-03",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "You know four of them from Stage one. Here are nine.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-title-04",
   "scene": "c02-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The noun after each one is jarr.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:The noun after each one is jarr."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-01",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مِنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:1",
    "mark:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-02",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "From.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-03",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "خَرَجَ مِنَ البَيْتِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-04",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He went out of the house. The house is jarr, with kasra.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-05",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "إِلَى",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:2",
    "mark:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-06",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-07",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "ذَهَبَ إِلَى المَسْجِدِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-08",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "He went to the mosque.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-09",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:3",
    "mark:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-10",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "About, or away from.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-11",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الدَّرْسُ عَنِ القَمَرِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-12",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The lesson is about the moon.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-13",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَى",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:4",
    "mark:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-14",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-15",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الكِتَابُ عَلَى المَكْتَبِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-16",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The book is on the desk.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-17",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فِي",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:5",
    "mark:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-18",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-19",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الطَّالِبُ فِي الفَصْلِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-20",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The student is in the classroom.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-21",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The sixth ḥarf means with, or by. It is written joined to the word after it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:6",
    "mark:6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-22",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كَتَبْتُ بِالقَلَمِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-23",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I wrote with the pen.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-24",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The seventh means for, or belongs to. It is joined too.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:7",
    "mark:7"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-25",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الكِتَابُ لِمُحَمَّدٍ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-26",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The book belongs to Muhammad.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-27",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The eighth means like. It is joined too.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:8",
    "mark:8"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-28",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "البِنْتُ كَالقَمَرِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-29",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The girl is like the moon.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-30",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "حَتَّى",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:9",
    "mark:9"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-31",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Until.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-32",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "جَلَسْتُ فِي المَسْجِدِ حَتَّى الظُّهْرِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-33",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "I sat in the mosque until noon.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-table-34",
   "scene": "c02-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In every example, the noun after the ḥarf is jarr.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "mark:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-01",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Two small changes before al.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-02",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Look at the ḥarf that means from. It ends in sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-03",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مِنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-04",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Before al, it takes a fatha.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:مِنْ becomes مِنَ: مِنَ البَيْتِ."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-05",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مِنَ البَيْتِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-06",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The ḥarf that means about also ends in sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-07",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-08",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Before al, it takes a kasra.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:عَنْ becomes عَنِ: عَنِ القَمَرِ."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-09",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَنِ القَمَرِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-rule-10",
   "scene": "c02-rule",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This is only a helping vowel for easy speaking. The ḥarf is still fixed.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-01",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A tip. Three of these ḥarfs are written joined to the next word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "show",
    "hl:are written joined to the next word"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-02",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They mean with, for, and like.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-03",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Look at the ḥarf that means for. Before al, the alif of al drops out.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "hl:drops the alif"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-04",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لِلمُدَرِّسِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c02-tip-05",
   "scene": "c02-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "For the teacher.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-01",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter three. The joining ḥarfs.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-02",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "حُرُوفُ العَطْفِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-03",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "They join a word to the word before it.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-title-04",
   "scene": "c03-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The rule from Stage one stays. The word after them copies the ending of the word before.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:the word after them copies the ending of the word before"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-01",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The first is wa. It means and. It is written joined to the next word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:1",
    "mark:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-02",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "الكِتَابُ وَالقَلَمُ عَلَى المَكْتَبِ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-03",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The book and the pen are on the desk. The pen copies the damma of the book.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-04",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The second ḥarf is also joined. It means and, right after.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:2",
    "mark:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-05",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "دَخَلَ مُحَمَّدٌ فَخَالِدٌ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-06",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Muhammad came in, and Khalid right after him.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-07",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "ثُمَّ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:3",
    "mark:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-08",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Then, after a while.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-09",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "خَرَجَ حَامِدٌ ثُمَّ يَاسِرٌ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-10",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Hamid went out, then Yasir.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-11",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The fourth ḥarf means or.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:4",
    "mark:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-12",
   "scene": "c03-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِشْرَبِ المَاءَ أَوِ اللَّبَنَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c03-table-13",
