   "scene": "c06-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "O Bilal. O old man.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-title-01",
   "scene": "c07-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter seven. A ḥarf or an ism? Look-alikes.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-title-02",
   "scene": "c07-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Some ḥarfs look like isms. And some short question words are isms.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-title-03",
   "scene": "c07-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Read the vowels carefully.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "hl:Read the vowels carefully."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-01",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مِنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:1",
    "mark:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-02",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "From. A ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-03",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَنْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-04",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Who. An ism. Only the first vowel is different.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-05",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَى",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:2",
    "mark:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-06",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On. A ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-07",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلِيٌّ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-08",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Ali, a name. An ism.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-09",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "هَلْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:3",
    "mark:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-10",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It starts a yes or no question. A ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-11",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "أَيْنَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-12",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Where. An ism. Both are used in questions. Only one is a ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-13",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Next, the ḥarf that means like. It is written joined to the next word.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "row:4",
    "mark:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-14",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كَمْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-15",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "How many. An ism. Both start with the same letter.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-01",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In short.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-02",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Every ḥarf is fixed and has no place.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "q:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-03",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لَا مَحَلَّ لَهُ مِنَ الإِعْرَابِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-04",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a jarr ḥarf, the next noun is jarr.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "q:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-05",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a joining ḥarf, the next word copies the ending of the word before.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "q:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-06",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The answer ḥarfs say yes and no.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "q:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-07",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "بَلَى",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-08",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This one says yes to a question with the word not in it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-09",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The question ḥarfs make a yes or no question.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "q:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-10",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After the calling ḥarf, a name takes one damma.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-11",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "يَا مُحَمَّدُ",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "summary-12",
   "scene": "summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Now it is your turn. Open the Practice tab.",
   "pause": 1.0,
   "cues": []
  }
 ]
}